{"4551470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hey, Don't Look at Me", "steam_appid": 4551470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You moved into your late grandmother's apartment to sort through her belongings and start a new life. On your very first night, a light appears in the window of the abandoned house across the street... <strong>someone is there.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.mp4?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is watching from the windows across the street?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey, Don't Look at Me</strong> is a psychological first-person horror game where you'll observe ghosts through binoculars, investigate the circumstances of their deaths, and try to survive inside your own apartment. Just don't forget: <strong>sometimes, they're watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed1b3a6.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed1b3a6.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed1b3a6.mp4?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk to the dead. They don't know how they died.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the ghosts relive the final moments of their lives. They feel the fear and pain, but they don't understand <strong>what happened to them</strong>. Watch them closely: look for anything out of place, listen to every sound, use the objects you find, and talk to those who don't even know they're already dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/bc603abb6f21fb459bdb04624eda8186.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/bc603abb6f21fb459bdb04624eda8186.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/bc603abb6f21fb459bdb04624eda8186.mp4?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't watch them for too long.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you set all the lost souls free and escape the house that refuses to let you go? Or will there come a night when the silhouette in the window across the street is <strong>yours</strong>?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/322e16b4d046805b0fd1b7da107d9616.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/322e16b4d046805b0fd1b7da107d9616.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/322e16b4d046805b0fd1b7da107d9616.mp4?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You moved into your late grandmother's apartment to sort through her belongings and start a new life. On your very first night, a light appears in the window of the abandoned house across the street... <strong>someone is there.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/3c0ded5077623b972fb21dea0763ce6c.mp4?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is watching from the windows across the street?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey, Don't Look at Me</strong> is a psychological first-person horror game where you'll observe ghosts through binoculars, investigate the circumstances of their deaths, and try to survive inside your own apartment. Just don't forget: <strong>sometimes, they're watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed1b3a6.poster.avif?t=1787929025\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed1b3a6.webm?t=1787929025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551470/extras/0c343f46967d24cd1ce24711aed